@page
@model AboutModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}

<section class="gg-hero py-5">
    <div class="container">
        <h1 class="display-6 fw-bold">About the Foundation</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-0">A beacon of hope in times of crisis, delivering swift and effective aid to
            communities struck by natural disasters and emergencies in South Africa and beyond.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row g-4">
            <div class="col-lg-7">
                <h2 class="h4">Our story</h2>
                <p>The Gift of the Givers Foundation was established in response to the growing need for
                    organised relief efforts. The foundation operates on the principles of compassion,
                    efficiency and resilience, with a diverse team of volunteers and experts working to make a
                    tangible difference in the lives of those affected by adversity.</p>
                <p>Recent global challenges have made reliable disaster relief solutions more important than
                    ever. This platform is the foundation's centralised hub for managing relief efforts,
                    coordinating volunteers and allocating resources during a crisis, so that technology and
                    humanitarian aid work together to reach more people, faster.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-5">
                <div class="gg-card p-4">
                    <h2 class="h5">What we stand for</h2>
                    <ul class="mb-0">
                        <li class="mb-2"><strong>Compassion</strong> — dignity for every person we assist.</li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><strong>Efficiency</strong> — aid on the ground within hours, not weeks.</li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><strong>Resilience</strong> — rebuilding communities beyond the emergency.</li>
                        <li><strong>Accountability</strong> — every donation traceable to a relief project.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p class="small text-muted mt-4 mb-0">
            Source: Gift of the Givers Foundation. 2025. [Online]. Available at:
            <a href="https://giftofthegivers.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://giftofthegivers.org</a>
            [Accessed 29 September 2025].
        </p>
    </div>
</section>
